{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.5_(Modified_from_Official_Solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.5 (Modified from Official Solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d588b041ffa28a2f791e26a59500e954a83826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(7, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a5f201edd83a4e4523103dcb5d4c57855c7991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(a, 2a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04c89f931de8a8366f47239bd88d2bd4cfae1934.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(12, 30)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" /> lie on a straight line.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can find the equation of the line from the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and then plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77ba6189a32e5ead2cbb44585ede2285792545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fc673027f01f1177931f364339945384613c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> from point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> to find out what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is.\n</p><p>The slope would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/f/11ff33ec6cc90e1c17e94862b5891082bcd91d70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30 - 5}{12 - 7} = \\frac{25}{5} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"135\" height=\"40\" />. This means that the equation of the line would be of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b0777a5854eb81ac0787e00f2cc1520e94899c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5x + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of the line.\n</p><p>Next, we know that the line goes through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/e/c1ea2250fdb7d65c0cea0f32a3cd54384c05782e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, which would correspond to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. Plugging in these values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> into our equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/5/4a511d5e95c0a4f8f78d76f0fe1ecb773bcf2995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 = 5 \\times 7 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/7/1e71ffafe4671eb3ccf013a24a215b67177eb29f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 35 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec17e214a3cd765f3382bfbee03d0ade7e1c8b1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5 - 35 = \\boxed{-30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"151\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>This means that the equation of the line would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c1c3eb8795aa2c25f93318ad76f2bf56b079e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5x - 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Next, we know that the line goes through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555f6a0b89a0a1bf275859e4c8297717161ce4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, 2a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, which would correspond to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77ba6189a32e5ead2cbb44585ede2285792545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fc673027f01f1177931f364339945384613c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77ba6189a32e5ead2cbb44585ede2285792545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fc673027f01f1177931f364339945384613c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> into the equation of the line, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbd8b2bc9154ee709994092d0018ecc1eff502d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 5 \\times a - 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b20f2440b71a285a76f2227a5b1e0276656ca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 = 5a - 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f7222b8d84e51c7f53d2ee5fcfaa1e5a67cf7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90d9be3e9d4b6e82ed659abf79e46ff5bc79728f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{30}{3} = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1.5_.28Modified_from_Official_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.5_(Modified_from_Official_Solution)\">Solution 1.5 (Modified from Official Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.5 (Modified from Official Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the same process as solution 1 to find that the slope of the line would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, instead of using slope-intercept form, we can use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Point-slope_form\" title=\"Point-slope form\">point-slope form</a>.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/a/11af515956d2fa847b77d1ae0e81258a08a55aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 5$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, and the line goes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/e/c1ea2250fdb7d65c0cea0f32a3cd54384c05782e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, the equation of the line would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c005067013888898a4bd31ab49c89578801318.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - 5 = 5(x - 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Because the line goes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555f6a0b89a0a1bf275859e4c8297717161ce4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, 2a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, we can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77ba6189a32e5ead2cbb44585ede2285792545c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/f/38fc673027f01f1177931f364339945384613c50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> into the equation of the line to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53f203dc2cafb7f0144bfa3d9454fe25d074a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a - 5 = 5(a - 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04e0f2c5d6dfbbe5ff1281a40aef6833df819391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a - 5 = 5 \\times a - 5 \\times 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"180\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267dc13c586dd2357fe4723048b406a4f32494b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a - 2a = 5 \\times 7 - 5 = 5 \\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f7222b8d84e51c7f53d2ee5fcfaa1e5a67cf7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/d/90d9be3e9d4b6e82ed659abf79e46ff5bc79728f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{30}{3} = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are all on the same straight line, the slope from a line connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> must be the same as the slope from a line connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The slope of a line connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/707302fb94165450eaaebff4e5f0d851b9f9938e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a - 5}{a - 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"56\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>The slope of a line connecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> would be:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/7898cb9a2509a120054865e3e696fc10f92f14d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30 - 2a}{12 - a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"65\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Setting these equal to each other, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a129c94f8fcf56d8ae43d9d6c19eba27c31ac82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2a - 5}{a - 7} = \\frac{30 - 2a}{12 - a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6c0c1a02ad8e9263daaa0084313b27847f3a2d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a - 5)(12 - a) = (30 - 2a)(a - 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"283\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/175878eb9cc9fc43ac31a9c05e83bb7d1b0fd537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a \\times 12 - 2a \\times a - 5 \\times 12 -5 \\times -a = 30 \\times a - 30 \\times 7 - 2a \\times a - 2a \\times -7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"588\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abff0ef642dbc35495a390c8c91e9637b3b2b899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24a - 2a^{2} - 60 + 5a = 30a - 210 - 2a^{2} + 14a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"359\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29a9dabd458ef75fdb9b2eac54f7a70a85d40439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2a^{2} + 29a - 60 = -2a^{2} + 44a - 210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0dabe6029a774ce01b9a77bc59df244fced9f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-60 + 210 = -2a^{2} + 44a + 2a^{2} - 29a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0ae629a85b2ef8f3478d5fbea7426613bbc45f50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150 = 15a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/b/f4b83aa823bd1b36cd3cf8c7e93b34776300f430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{150}{15} = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001928\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 295/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11698/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.251      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.251      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35963:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001928 and revision id 279529. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}